/**
 * GENERATED by tools/brand-icons/build.mjs — do not edit by hand.
 *
 * One icon set, fifteen colourings. Every theme draws the same Phosphor (MIT) glyph for
 * a module, on the same plate geometry in white ink, so the home board keeps one
 * shape and one icon per module whatever theme is picked. Only the plate colours
 * change, which is what lets an icon still match its theme's palette.
 */
